          "explanation": "In 'اَلَمْ', at the last letter (position 3 of 3), there is Meem Sakin (مْ). The next letter 'ن' comes from 'نَشْرَحْ'. Since the next letter is neither Ba nor Meem, the rule is Izhar Shafawi (إظهار شفوي): pronounce Meem clearly, without ghunnah and without merging.",
